  "outcomes": [
    "Compile, run, and debug Java SE programs using a versioned JDK.",
    "Apply control flow, methods, arrays, classes, exceptions, generics, collections, and streams to practical tasks.",
    "Use files, HTTP, JDBC, and concurrency with clear validation and resource-management behavior.",
    "Test, diagnose, secure, package, and maintain Java applications.",
    "Distinguish Java SE 25 stable core learning from version-specific preview features and optional specializations."
  ],
